<p>A heraldry texture is a simple way of customizing a shield or other compatible piece of armor. The Heraldry 2DA associates heraldry textures with labels, which are used by <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/BITM%20base.xls" title="BITM base">BITM_base</a> when texturing items.
</p>
